Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:07.91,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,00)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 16 \N {\fs100} Young Traveler {旅の若者の巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.53,0:00:30.47,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Five years ago, a gallant young man came \Nfrom a far eastern country, looking for immortality. {wizardry; secret of immortality}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.92,0:00:47.28,Narrator,,0,0,0,,There was no way the nymphs \Ncould leave this young man alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.08,0:00:50.46,Narrator,,0,0,0,,So what happened next?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.80,0:01:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go mingling with him! {lit: don't date such a guy}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.03,0:01:26.20,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Woah, their wild love is so fierce.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.56,0:01:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.72,0:01:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, he must've gotten in the way of the horses' love and got kicked for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.02,0:02:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.92,0:02:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll feel better in no time.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.19,0:02:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go gather some herbs.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.49,0:02:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sister?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.49,0:02:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This book is so very fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.09,0:03:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's weird...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.19,0:03:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with her?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.59,0:03:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? I see now.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.64,0:03:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.64,0:03:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what the real one is up to...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.52,0:03:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.28,0:03:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as expected!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.41,0:03:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've read it in the book:\Nlove is something you take away.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.71,0:03:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.26,0:03:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still looking for herbs? {?????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.15,0:04:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.49,0:04:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.91,0:04:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.24,0:04:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.10,0:04:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.54,0:04:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My, you're exactly like the person I've always dreamed of.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.86,0:04:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hate it... {there's no way for her to know it was a woman}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.88,0:04:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.09,0:05:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they are, the culprit.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.69,0:05:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was her!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.89,0:05:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know just what to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.73,0:05:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, who knocked just...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.24,0:05:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's you, sister?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.80,0:05:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the weather nice today?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.97,0:05:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel so light you can fly \Non days like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.66,0:05:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.77,0:05:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.48,0:05:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh! She tricked me!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.60,0:05:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.35,0:06:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I'd ever let anyone take from me \Na lovely man such as you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.48,0:06:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.17,0:06:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.20,0:06:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, now she's really serious about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.27,0:06:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, you're finally awake.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.39,0:06:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.82,0:07:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I need to act fast. {lit: dangerous place/time - think she means "that other nymph is getting too close to winning him over"}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.20,0:07:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.37,0:07:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've traveled three thousand miles\N from a distant country in the east.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. And what for?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.67,0:07:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want wealth or honor, \NI only want to learn from the hermits. {lit: learn the techniques of ...}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.68,0:07:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. Then I'd be happy \Nto teach you the basics.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.60,0:07:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be honored to study under someone \Nwho's as beautiful as you are. {??????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.37,0:07:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'm that beautiful?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.66,0:07:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been told that I'm beautiful \Nby a person who's as lovely and nice as you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.07,0:07:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The other villagers just keep saying \Nthat I remind them of Marilyn Monroe.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.18,0:08:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Was my herb medicine not good enough?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.66,0:08:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,His heart will be mine from now on. \NMine alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.97,0:08:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? That's weird, his heart is gone!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.41,0:08:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.12,0:08:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart thief! Help! {????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.77,0:08:56.44,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,500)}[number for calling the police in Japan]
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.45,0:09:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My, an arrest warrant?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.53,0:09:32.22,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,500)}[number for calling the fire department in Japan]
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.84,0:09:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, that is clearly unnecessary.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.78,0:09:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... I don't think we'll have a clear-cut answer. {???? no clue what's this joke and why they suddenly started dividing it} {more about how they'll reamain unsettled as there's no way to "divide it" cleanly}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.95,0:09:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,God, you're noisy! \NYou women are incorrigible!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.17,0:09:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Elder...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.06,0:09:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me that heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.55,0:10:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.18,0:10:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes and take a closer look. {??? literal}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.64,0:10:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think there'd be \Na place for you two in there? {?????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy isn't in it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.20,0:10:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not in here either.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the weather nice?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.66,0:10:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a walk in the sky. \NAre you with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.17,0:10:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea. In this glamorous blue sky, like the little birds.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.97,0:10:55.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just a common \Noccurrence in our world.
